<title>GREECE: TABLE - Greek/Bund gap widens to 403bps, 299 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Greek/Bund gap widens to 403bps, 299 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened to 403 basis points on Wednesday from Tuesday's 397.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also grew to 299 basis points from 296 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.73%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.70%	403	397 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.64%	409	404 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.74%	299	296 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.39%	334	331 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.37%	336	332 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.18%	255	244 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.35%	338	330 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0900 GMT. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
